En":"Skillful Cooking","maxLevel":1,"desc":"当前角色烹饪时有概率产出特色料理","descEn":"Has a chance to produce special dishes when cooking.","params":[],"hits":[],"confidence":"high","nonCombat":true,"skillIcon":"assets/skills/1002508.webp?v=8daac4de124b"},{"id":1002509,"type":11,"typeName":"延奏技能","typeNameEn":"Outro Skill","name":"双联合相","nameEn":"Binary Butterfly","maxLevel":1,"desc":"守岸人召唤一只耀星·蝶和一只黯星·蝶环绕队伍中登场角色，最多存在30秒，并获得以下效果：\n·若队伍中登场角色处于受击或被击飞状态中，点按闪避将脱离受击状态或被击飞状态，并视为闪避成功，若处于低空，则会回到地面。该效果最多可触发5次。\n·队伍中的角色全伤害加深15%。","descEn":"Shorekeeper summons 1 Flare Star Butterfly and 1 Dim Star Butterfly to circle the Resonator on the field for up to 30s, granting the following effects:  \n- If the Resonator on the field is hit or launched, tapping the Dodge Button allows the Resonator to immediately recover from the interruption, triggering a successful Dodge. The Resonator launched in the air can land on the ground standing if they are close to the ground. This effect can be triggered up to 5 time(s).\n- All nearby party members' DMG is Amplified by 15%.","params":[],"hits":[],"confidence":"high","skillIcon":"assets/skills/1002509.webp?v=ad334fa71322"},{"id":1002510,"type":12,"typeName":"谐度破坏","typeNameEn":"Tune Break","name":"谐度破坏·音感仪","nameEn":"Tune Break: Rectifier","maxLevel":1,"desc":"目标【偏谐值】满时，可对其施放【谐度破坏】。","descEn":"When the target's Off-Tune Level is full, the Resonator may cast Tune Break on the target.","params":[],"hits":[],"confidence":"high","skillIcon":"assets/skills/1002510.webp?v=971abf8dcde6"}],"energy":{"liberationCost":175.0,"energyMaxTable":175.0,"consistent":true,"concertoMax":100.0},"inherents":[{"name":"死生流溢","nameEn":"Life Entwined","desc":"队伍中有守岸人自身以外的角色受到致死伤害时，此次伤害不会使该角色倒下并获得守岸人当前50%生命值，守岸人扣除等量生命值。守岸人最少保留1点生命值，该效果每10分钟可触发1次。","node":4,"skillId":1002504,"type":4},{"name":"自我引力","nameEn":"Self Gravitation","desc":"队伍中登场角色处于星域生效范围内时，守岸人共鸣效率提升10%，若漂泊者处于同一编队中，漂泊者共鸣效率提升10%。","node":5,"skillId":1002505,"type":4}],"statNodes":[{"node":9,"title":"治疗效果加成提升","props":[{"ke